#: certification/admin/templates/document-signing.php:38
#: certification/admin/templates/document-signing.php:86
msgid "Signing turn"
msgstr "Turno de firma"

#: certification/admin/templates/document-signing.php:54
msgid ""
"Who signs this document and in which turn. Every user with a marked role "
"receives their own document (its data are theirs, F1) and signs it from "
"their own account. The other signers sign that same document. «Signing turn» "
"decides who signs first: for example, a signer by variable (such as the "
"parent) can sign before whoever receives the document; that person sees it "
"read-only until it is their turn. The document is valid when all the "
"signatures are done. Changes apply to new signature requests; requests "
"already in progress keep their signers and turns."
msgstr "Quién firma este documento y en qué turno. Cada usuario con un rol marcado recibe su propio documento (los datos son los suyos, F1) y lo firma desde su propia cuenta. Los demás firmantes firman ese mismo documento. «Turno de firma» decide quién firma primero: por ejemplo, un firmante por variable (como el representante) puede firmar antes que quien recibe el documento; esa persona lo ve en solo lectura hasta que le toque. El documento es válido cuando están todas las firmas. Los cambios se aplican a las solicitudes de firma nuevas; las solicitudes en curso conservan sus firmantes y sus turnos."

#: certification/admin/templates/document-signing.php:86
msgid ""
"Who signs first: the lowest number. Consecutive system signers sign at the "
"same time."
msgstr "Firma primero el número más bajo. Los firmantes del sistema seguidos firman a la vez."

#: certification/admin/templates/document-signing.php:148
msgid ""
"Signers by variable sign in the turn you choose, also before whoever "
"receives the document: whoever has the first turn opens the document, fills "
"in its additional fields and signs first. Each person signs only once: if "
"the variable gives the account of someone who already signs (for example, an "
"adult student who is their own parent), that row is skipped and the turns "
"move up."
